"76_reflection.mst — MACDART: class reflection over Dart Types.

 MACVM's ClassMirror/Behavior read a class's name / superclass / own selectors /
 own variables straight from the class OBJECT's layout (instVarAt: KLASS_*_INDEX
 and the numbered reflection primitives 98/99/157/158). MACDART classes are Dart
 Types with a different layout, so those bare <primitive: N> bodies answered the
 receiver. This overlay re-points the layout-dependent methods at the VM's real
 Class API through <stprim:> natives — the corpus (34_tools.mst, 03_behavior.mst)
 stays verbatim; reopen replaces the same-selector methods here. Loads after both
 (file 76), so ClassMirror and Behavior already exist."

Behavior >> name [ <stprim: stClassNameOf> ]
Behavior >> superclass [ <stprim: stSuperclassOf> ]

ClassMirror class >> allClasses [ <stprim: stAllClasses> ]
ClassMirror class >> selectorsOf: aBehavior [ <stprim: stSelectorsOf> ]
ClassMirror class >> instanceVariablesOf: aBehavior [ <stprim: stInstVarNamesOf> ]
ClassMirror class >> classVariablesOf: aBehavior [ <stprim: stClassVarNamesOf> ]
